<view class="page"><view class="brand">给个交代</view><view class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:70rpx">FLAG · SAY IT · DO IT · COME BACK</view><view class="hero">立个 FLAG。<br/>给个交代。</view><view class="sub">把那件一直想做的事说清楚。<br/>说出去，然后带着结果回来。</view><button class="button" bindtap="create">写下这件事　→</button><view class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:64rpx">还在做</view><block wx:if="{{active.length}}"><view class="card" wx:for="{{active}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="tag">进行中</view><view class="flag-title" style="margin-top:18rpx">{{item.goal}}</view><view class="meta"><text>到 {{item.deadline}}</text><text>回来给个交代</text></view></view></block><view wx:else class="muted" style="margin-top:20rpx">现在还没有。先立一面。</view><view class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:54rpx">已经有结果</view><view wx:if="{{finished.length}}" class="card" wx:for="{{finished}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="tag">{{item.result==='done'?'站住了':'没站住'}}</view><view class="flag-title" style="margin-top:18rpx">{{item.goal}}</view></view><button class="button ghost" bindtap="me">我的 FLAG　→</button></view>